                      "rule": "Sujeto + Verbo de rutina en presente + at [Hora].",
                      "formula": "[ Sujeto ] + [ verbo de rutina ] + [ at + hora exacta ]",
                      "example": "I wake up at 6:30 AM every morning and take a refreshing shower.",
