                      "subject": "Visit ➔ Visited • Travel ➔ Traveled • Walk ➔ Walked • Play ➔ Played • Enjoy ➔ Enjoyed",
                      "rule": "Añade -ed (o solo -d si ya termina en e: like ➔ liked).",
                      "formula": "[ Sujeto ] + [ Verbo con -ed ] + [ Complemento de viaje ]",
                      "example": "Last December, my family visited the beautiful beaches of Santa Marta.",
