                  "goldenRule": "1) TOO va ANTES del adjetivo (too hot, too expensive, too slow). 2) ENOUGH va DESPUÉS del adjetivo (fast enough, warm enough, loud enough). 3) ENOUGH va ANTES de un sustantivo (enough time, enough money, enough storage).",
