                      "audio": "Could that strange light in the night sky be a weather drone?",
                      "avatarPrompt": "3D Pixar Disney style animated teen character showing \"Could that strange light in the night sky be a weather drone?\", isolated on pure solid flat white background, no background bokeh, clean 3D character render",
