                      "type": "question-yn",
                      "label": "4. Preguntas de Hipótesis Pasada (? Yes/No): COULD THEY HAVE...?",
                      "subject": "Could they have decoded the ancient manuscript? • Could she have forgotten?",
                      "rule": "Inicia con Could + Sujeto + have + Participio Pasado.",
