                      "type": "negative",
                      "label": "3. Preposiciones de Contraste: DESPITE & IN SPITE OF",
                      "subject": "Despite the financial constraints • In spite of facing skepticism from critics",
                      "rule": "Llevan sustantivo o gerundio (-ING) inmediatamente después.",
                      "formula": "[ Despite + sustantivo / verbo-ING ] , [ la solución se logró con éxito ]",
