                "title": "Grammar Studio: Diplomatic Hedging & Softening Architecture / Arquitectura de Suavización Diplomática",
                "description": "Verbos tentativos (venture to suggest, tend to) | Pasivas impersonales (It is widely acknowledged) | Atenuadores (somewhat, relatively)",
